(a) pooling with dissemination price d and latency l   [w*s2 = 1, c = 1]
    N    d/c     local  central*    closed l_crit/T*
    4   0.00     5.657     2.828     2.828     0.500
    4   0.05     5.657     3.098     3.098     0.452
    4   0.50     5.657     4.899     4.899     0.134
    4   1.00     5.657     6.325     6.325    -0.118
   16   0.00    22.627     5.657     5.657     0.750
   16   0.05    22.627     7.589     7.589     0.665
   16   0.50    22.627    16.971    16.971     0.250
