  100   0.00   141.421    14.142    14.142     0.900
  100   0.05   141.421    34.641    34.641     0.755
  100   0.50   141.421   100.995   100.995     0.286
  100   1.00   141.421   142.127   142.127    -0.005
central wins at zero latency iff d/c < 1 - 1/N; with latency iff l < T*_local * (1 - sqrt((1 + N d/c)/N)).  (negative = never)

