(c) union with the direct light ball around the centre (centre sits at a station; budget l*; hop latency tau):
     nu     l*    tau   covered
      0   0.20   0.00     0.030
      0   0.20   0.10     0.030
      0   0.20   0.19     0.030
     10   0.20   0.00     0.301
     10   0.20   0.10     0.071
     10   0.20   0.19     0.030
    100   0.20   0.00     0.967
    100   0.20   0.10     0.365
    100   0.20   0.19     0.030
   1000   0.20   0.00     1.000
   1000   0.20   0.10     0.985
   1000   0.20   0.19     0.034
nu = 0 is the no-wormhole bound (a light ball); hop latency tau eats the budget l*; coverage -> 1 as station density rises and tau -> 0.
